        "total_pages": 2,
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "Msanifu. Msikilizaji. Mwandishi. Waandishi."
        },
        "content": [
          "机器需要制造者。m-/wa- 类名词",
          "由动词派生而来：",
          "",
          "   kusanifu  ->  msanifu   设计师",
          "   kusikiliza -> msikilizaji 听众",
          "   kuandika  ->  mwandishi  作家",
          "",
          "两种后缀：-aji 表示习惯性行为者，",
          "-i/-shi 表示职业或技艺。复数均用 wa-：",
          "",
          "",
          "   wasanifu, wasikilizaji, waandishi",
          "",
          "听发音：                              按 1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "page": 2,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "Makocha. Madereva. Makocha wale wanafundisha vizuri."
        },
        "content": [
          "借来的职业词在卡片上表现不同：",
          "",
          "",
          "   kocha  ->  makocha   教练们",
          "   dereva ->  madereva  司机们",
          "   rais   ->  marais    总统们",
          "",
          "用 ma- 构复数，一致关系仍用 wa-（表人）",
          "",
          "   Makocha wale wanafundisha vizuri.",
          "   那些教练教得很好。",
          "",
          "听发音：                              按 1",
          "",
